+
+Before you call submit_diagnosis, check these three things:
+1. List every abnormal finding you have (exam, tests, history). Does your diagnosis explain each
+   one? If an exam or test finding conflicts with what the patient told you, trust the objective
+   finding.
+2. Is there a closely related diagnosis that differs by one feature (for example, hearing loss,
+   fever, or the location of a lesion)? If so, choose the one your findings actually support.
+3. Is your diagnosis the specific disease name, not a broader category?
